---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us"
  description="Studio story and design approach preview. Business facts await approval."
>
  <header class="page-intro shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">About Us · Studio preview</p><h1>
      Space begins<br /><em>with people.</em>
    </h1><p class="page-lede">
      This story is a placeholder for the studio's real history, team, and point
      of view. No experience or track record is claimed here.
    </p>
  </header>
  <section class="section-band" data-reveal>
    <div class="shell section-split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Our story · Placeholder</p><h2>
          Designed to feel lived in.
        </h2>
      </div><div>
        <p>
          Every project can begin with a simple question: how should this place
          feel and work for the people using it? The final studio story will be
          written from supplied facts.
        </p><p>
          Until then, this page shows the tone and structure of an About Us page
          without asserting a founding date, team size, or past work.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="foundation-section shell" data-reveal>
    <p class="eyebrow">Guiding values · Proposed copy</p><div
      class="value-grid"
    >
      <article>
        <span>01 /</span><h3>Listen first</h3><p>
          Understand routines, needs, and aspirations before shaping a
          direction.
        </p>
      </article><article>
        <span>02 /</span><h3>Make room</h3><p>
          Give each space enough clarity, warmth, and breathing room.
        </p>
      </article><article>
        <span>03 /</span><h3>Care in detail</h3><p>
          Consider material, light, and the everyday experience together.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div><p class="content-note">
      Values are proposed editorial copy, pending studio approval.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="section-band">
    <div class="shell section-split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Approach & capabilities</p><h2>
          One idea, carried through.
        </h2>
      </div><div>
        <p>
          Planning, interiors, renovation, styling, and project coordination are
          shown as potential capabilities. Confirmed scope will replace these
          placeholders.
        </p><a class="text-link" href="/services"
          >Explore service placeholders <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="foundation-section shell contact-callout">
    <p class="eyebrow">Begin here</p><h2>Tell us about your space.</h2><a
      class="button"
      href="/contact">Contact the studio</a
    >
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
